力后，使得曹操成功脫險。后隨曹操南征，犯法被免官，不久又官復原職。數年后病逝。","en":"An officer of Cao Wei. He joined Cao Cao when the latter first raised his banner in Chenliu, campaigned alongside him across various regions, and offered counsel on many occasions. During the Battle of Weinan, when Cao Cao was nearly caught by Ma Chao's pursuit, Ding Fei released cattle and horses to distract the enemy while Xu Chu shielded Cao Cao, enabling his narrow escape. He later accompanied Cao Cao on his southern campaign, was dismissed from office for breaking the law, but was soon restored to his post. He died of illness several years later.","jp":"曹魏の武将。曹操が陳留で挙兵した初期から身を寄せ、各地の転戦に従い、度々進言を行った。渭南の戦いにおいて、曹操が馬超に追撃され危機に陥った際、許褚の護衛のもと、丁斐が牛馬を放って敵軍の注意を引いたことで、曹操は無事に窮地を脱した。後に曹操の南征に従ったが、法を犯して免官され、間もなく復職した。数年後に病死した。","kr":"조위의 무장. 일찍이 조조가 진류에서 거병했을 때 찾아와 의탁하였으며, 조조를 따라 각지를 종군하며 여러 차례 진언을 올렸다. 위남 전투 당시 조조가 마초에게 쫓겨 목숨을 잃을 뻔했으나, 허저의 호위와 정비가 소와 말을 풀어 적군의 시선을 돌린 덕분에 조조는 무사히 위기를 벗어났다. 이후 조조를 따라 남정에 나섰다가 죄를 지어 면직당했으나, 얼마 지나지 않아 관직을 회복했다. 몇 년 뒤 병사했다."},"notRecommended":{"type":"0","year":"999","reason":{"zh":"","tc":"","en":"","jp":"","kr":""}},"raw":{"userIndex":"15","id":"WJ10855","remark":"","surname":"丁","surnameTc":"丁","surnameEn":"Ding","surnameJp":"丁","surnameKr":"정","surnameOther":"","name":"斐","nameTc":"斐","nameEn":"Fei","nameJp":"斐","nameKr":"비","nameOther":"","word":"文侯","wordTc":"文侯","wordEn":"Wenhou","wordJp":"文侯","wordKr":"문후","wordOther":"","icon":"丁斐","power":"WJ10001","rejectPower":"","rejectDuration":"0","ignoreUnRecruit":"0","ignoreUnSelectable":"0","unSelectable":"0","recruit":"1","travel":"0","state":"2","workYear":"189","city":"CS1023","gender":"0","rule":"47","force":"72","wise":"62","politics":"34","charm":"42","will":"70","ruleTalent":"6","forceTalent":"9","wiseTalent":"8","politicsTalent":"4","charmTalent":"5","willTalent":"9","weaponMaster":"22/22/53/22/22/17/50/22","battleAttribute":"1/1/1/1/1/1/1/1","debateAttribute":"1/1/1","warSkill":"","battleSkill":"","debateCard":"","warSoul":"","battleSoul":"","de